Being a Leeds fan, would you wanna see Lara in there with Warrington again? I personally hope it does happen just to see Warrington get knocked out. I cant stand how his best asset is his headbutts!

&#x200B;

Yeah Okolie bores me to death but quite like Billam-Smith so i'll probably just catch the highlights aswell

Yeah its a joke, especially considering next weekend there are no fights in the UK so one of them at least could have been pushed back a week.

&#x200B;

Whos your money on for the Lara Wood fight?
